# Archives and generated bundles
*.zip
*.apk

# Generated SSR bundles (the .tsx next to them is the tracked source).
# Already tracked, so these rules only stop NEW copies from being added; and
# "check:ssr-tv" still executes the tracked _ssr_tv_check.cjs: give that script
# a build step before removing the bundle from the index.
**/_ssr_tv_check.cjs
**/_ssr_tv_check.mjs

# Working folders at the repository root (analysis dumps, exports, attachments)
/analisi_pertini/
/raccolta_pertini/
/output/
/outputs/
/.codex-remote-attachments/

# Windows desktop app build artifacts
**/.packages/
**/obj/
**/publish/
